    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nFronting onto the vast and mature green area and boasting an exceptional extended rear garden, this nicely presented two bedroom semi detached family home offers well proportioned living accommodation throughout. At ground floor level the main entrance hallway leads to the open plan living/dining which boasts ceramic tiled flooring, wood surround solid fuel fireplace with connectivity to the stunning rear gardens via glazed door and open arch to the kitchen which is finished with oak style wall and base units, ample work surfaces and integrated appliances. To the first floor is a main bathroom and two substantial double bedrooms finished with carpeted flooring and built in wardrobes in one of the bedrooms. Ample off street parking is provided by the brick paved drive with gated side access, ample attic storage via stira stairs and every amenity within a short stroll including Lees Road sporting complex, ease off access to the inner relief road and to the main Lahinch Road with national and secondary schools and main business district all within a short stroll. Viewing is highly recommended and strictly by prior appointment with sole selling agents. PSL 002295"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 2.95m x 1.93m\nQuality tiled flooring, polished railed stairs leading to first floor landing incorporating ample understairs storage with connecting door to open plan living and dining.\n\nLiving/Dining - 6m x 3m\nQuality ceramic tiled flooring, wood surround feature fireplace with cast iron insert and polished marble flag, decorative ceiling coving and glass panel connecting doors leading to extensive fully walled rear gardens, door to understairs storage and open arch to kitchen.\n\nKitchen - 3.9m x 2.33m\nOak style built in wall and base units with ample work surfaces, tiled splashback surround, quality tiled flooring, integrated fan assisted oven and four ring gas hob with space for fridge freezer and space and plumbing for washing machine and dryer and decorative ceiling coving.\n\nFirst Floor Landing - 2m x 1.9m\nT&G polished wood flooring, stira stairs leading to additional attic storage and connecting doors to bedrooms one and two and main bathroom.\n\nBedroom One - 3.95m x 3.35\nQuality carpeted flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.9m x 1.8m\nLow level WC, wash hand basin with overhead electric shaver point and light with wall mounted mirror unit, corner fitted shower tray with overhead electric shower with sliding glass panel shower door, quality wall tiling and T&G polished timber flooring.\n\nBedroom Two - 3.85m x 3.5m\nQuality carpeted flooring, built in wardrobes with ample hanging rails with additional overhead and base storage and telephone point.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Eircode V95F8A0</li><li> Total Floor Space 70 m2</li><li> Built 2003</li><li> Mains Water</li><li> Mains Sewage</li><li> Mains Gas Central Heating</li><li> Fibre Broadband</ul>"
      },
      {
